# Normal Windows and Linux starts prompt for your vault passphrase.
# Dashboard defaults to 127.0.0.1:4203. Fabric listens on 127.0.0.1:4210.
# To test against a private server, uncomment before starting and pairing:
# AUTOSELL_GAME_HOST=localhost:25565
# Store Discord, Eldorado and wallet secrets in the encrypted dashboard vault.

# Optional language interpretation (disabled by default). Start with shadow.
# Shadow records decisions locally but cannot change chat or payments.
# Suggest asks the buyer to re-enter the exact IGN, then uses normal confirmation.
# Only ambiguous buyer text is sent to the selected provider; no order payload or credentials.
# AUTOSELL_CHAT_AI_MODE=shadow
# AUTOSELL_CHAT_AI_PROVIDER=gemini
# AUTOSELL_CHAT_AI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite
# AUTOSELL_CHAT_AI_API_KEY=<your API key, never share it in chat>
# Gemini free-tier quota and data-use policies apply; see AI-CHAT-SETUP.md.
# Existing OpenAI installations remain supported with PROVIDER=openai and an explicit model.
